The fairies and the Elemental Priestesses have begun the plan to lure the Snow Lady out of her fortress.
That way we can destroy the source of the glacial river, which is guarded inside the Snow Lady's Ice Palace, a place that in the past was the Snowstorm Dragon's refuge.
The Quintessence has the power to stop the river's flow.

Activate the Quintessence in Snowstorm Valley, in Gallubia Valley, and defeat the Snow Lady. A light will mark the place.

WARNING: If you are defeated or disconnect from the game during the battle against the Snow Lady, you must go back to Sage Celina for a new Quintessence and start over.

Come back here when you are done.
